# Tab separated with 4 columns:
# - value (stable identifier, selected by the tools and serialised into workflows)
# - name (shown in the user interface)
# - dbkey (build identifier, also used as the directory name below semibin/data/)
# - path (directory containing the mmseqs2 GTDB database)
#
# Example:
# GTDB_v95	GTDB v95 (MMseqs2 database used by SemiBin, Zenodo record 4751564)	gtdb_v95	/galaxy/data/semibin/data/gtdb_v95
